  "id": "hazard-control",
  "term": "hazard control",
  "definition": "Hazard control is the coordinated capability to manage dangerous or life-threatening situations as part of emergency response. In this context, it involves integrating medical and tactical action so responders can act comprehensively to protect people and other assets.",
